12. Constraints
The project may have the following constraints:
•	Internet connectivity is required for cloud-based AI functionality.
•	Gemini API usage may be subject to quotas and pricing.
•	AI-generated answers may occasionally contain inaccuracies and should be presented as assistance rather than guaranteed authoritative answers.
•	Uploaded documents may have size/type restrictions.
•	Response time can depend on network conditions and AI-service availability.
•	Student data and uploaded materials must be handled according to applicable privacy and security requirements.
