14. Minimum Viable Product (MVP)
For the initial version, the requirements can be narrowed to:
1.	User login/registration.
2.	AI Tutor using Gemini.
3.	Study-material upload.
4.	AI summarization.
5.	AI quiz generation.
6.	Quiz evaluation.
7.	Flashcard generation.
8.	Basic progress dashboard.
The study planner, voice interaction, advanced analytics, and multimodal learning can be implemented as future enhancements.
